Z||000006||mrfiero||06-22-2001||03:06 AM||||BAM-BAM,<P>I just checked on carparts.com and they are selling an '88 flexplate for $17.84!  <P>It's part #Z-185.  ATP is the brand name......it cross-references the GM part number (14100554), so it should be the right one. <P>The downside is it says it takes 10-15 days to ship since it is a special order.<P>Another option is to pull the flexplate off of late 80's/early 90's FWD 2.8/3.1's.  I see TONS of these in junkyards for about the same price.<P>  ||||reg||1
