Z||000009||Dave Gunsul||06-22-2001||02:33 PM||||Hey Bam, you can get the flexplate from GM the next day for the same price.<BR>Just make sure you order a flexplate for an 88 Fiero because it's internally balanced<BR>just like the 3.4.<BR>Bob from Twin Lakes Fiero told me that the<BR>88 flexplate that GM is selling is a beefier unit than the original so it would be a better idea to get that one than getting a<BR>used one. I'm using one in my 3.2.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
